This plugin includes a curated Cline wrapper and a bundled Domino MCP server derived from Domino Data Lab's MIT-licensed Domino plugin materials.

Upstream copyright:
Copyright (c) 2026 Domino Data Lab

Notable Cline-specific changes:
- Registers the MCP server from the installed plugin directory.
- Uses Cline skill packaging and setup guidance.
- Removes the browser-opening MCP tool to avoid host-side UI side effects.
